      "source": [
        "### Correlation Heatmap of Selected Features\n",
        "\n",
        "To better understand the relationships between the selected features, we can visualize their correlations using a heatmap. This helps identify highly correlated features, which can sometimes impact model stability or interpretability."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 1000
        },
